(487441, 47242, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field in this photo. I would have prefered if the entire woman was included in the shot though.</td>', 'I like the depth of field in this photo. I would have prefered if the entire woman was included in the shot though.', '2003-11-17 00:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487442, 47257, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot! This is very well executed the black background was a good choice</td>', 'Great shot! This is very well executed the black background was a good choice', '2003-11-17 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(487444, 47261, 12661, '<td valign="top">The depth of field doesn''t really work for me in this image. The 8-ball is central to the concept and as such, should have been in focus.</td>', 'The depth of field doesn''t really work for me in this image. The 8-ball is central to the concept and as such, should have been in focus.', '2003-11-17 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(487445, 46975, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot! This is wonderful, you captured this perfectly. ( 9 )</td>', 'Great shot! This is wonderful, you captured this perfectly. ( 9 )', '2003-11-17 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(487447, 46770, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative. This is a great shot</td>', 'Very imaginative. This is a great shot', '2003-11-17 00:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(487448, 47358, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  Wonderfully clear and crisp!  9</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  Wonderfully clear and crisp!  9', '2003-11-17 00:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(487451, 46562, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great set up , wonderful colors, makes me hungry!</td>', 'Great set up , wonderful colors, makes me hungry!', '2003-11-17 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487454, 47140, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is great, I love the way you captured this shot, great job (10 )</td>', 'This is great, I love the way you captured this shot, great job (10 )', '2003-11-17 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(487456, 46825, 10978, '<td valign="top">A nice crisp shot, I just would like to see a bit more of the drain. It is hard to see it there with such a tight shot. Still a good Idea I like it ............7</td>', 'A nice crisp shot, I just would like to see a bit more of the drain. It is hard to see it there with such a tight shot. Still a good Idea I like it ............7', '2003-11-17 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(487457, 47288, 6008, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but there are a few technical things that I think could be improved on. The background - it has texture, but I think in this case you dont want to distract from the texture of the nuts and the hammer.  There are also creases in it that dont add anything to the image. The hammer/nuts are also a little too close to the back of the fabric and so there is a little too much focus on it. The hammer - it''s aged, which adds character, that''s good, howeve, either there are too many scratches or the light is pointed too directly at the head. The bright white is too distracting and loses the uniform color tone otherwise present. The angle and crop of the hammer could probably have been improved too. Suggestions - either shoot it in mid-swing, or put more of the handle in the frame and perhaps having it coming in at a diagonal from the upper right. The nuts are good, but the splintered shell parts just clutter up the fabric and look like flecks/spots.</td>', 'The idea is good but there are a few technical things that I think could be improved on. The background - it has texture, but I think in this case you dont want to distract from the texture of the nuts and the hammer.  There are also creases in it that dont add anything to the image. The hammer/nuts are also a little too close to the back of the fabric and so there is a little too much focus on it. The hammer - it''s aged, which adds character, that''s good, howeve, either there are too many scratches or the light is pointed too directly at the head. The bright white is too distracting and loses the uniform color tone otherwise present. The angle and crop of the hammer could probably have been improved too. Suggestions - either shoot it in mid-swing, or put more of the handle in the frame and perhaps having it coming in at a diagonal from the upper right. The nuts are good, but the splintered shell parts just clutter up the fabric and look like flecks/spots.', '2003-11-17 00:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487459, 46672, 10978, '<td valign="top">very creative, and makes me laugh I like it.......7</td>', 'very creative, and makes me laugh I like it.......7', '2003-11-17 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(487460, 46723, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think using black and white has helped bring out the textures of the shoe. It''s an unusual-looking shoe so I think that helps with bringing interest into the shot. The dark edges on either side are a little unfortunate.</td>', 'I think using black and white has helped bring out the textures of the shoe. It''s an unusual-looking shoe so I think that helps with bringing interest into the shot. The dark edges on either side are a little unfortunate.', '2003-11-17 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(487461, 46914, 13336, '<td valign="top">what are you trying to suggest here?  this is awefully disrespectful.  i hope you at least got this man''s permission to take his picture and post it online...</td>', 'what are you trying to suggest here?  this is awefully disrespectful.  i hope you at least got this man''s permission to take his picture and post it online...', '2003-11-17 00:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487462, 46672, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea executed perfectly!</td>', 'Very creative idea executed perfectly!', '2003-11-17 00:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487464, 47253, 6008, '<td valign="top">The reflections are good, contrast is good, although the eggs seem just a tad dark. Composition seems fine too. Nicely captured.</td>', 'The reflections are good, contrast is good, although the eggs seem just a tad dark. Composition seems fine too. Nicely captured.', '2003-11-17 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487465, 47365, 12661, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was a cracked glass on top of bills but it just didn''t look right. Then I realized everything is mirror imaged so it must be a reflection on a cracked mirror.  Either way, it''s a wonderful idea but I think it would have worked a bit better if everything wasn''t mirrored.</td>', 'At first I thought it was a cracked glass on top of bills but it just didn''t look right. Then I realized everything is mirror imaged so it must be a reflection on a cracked mirror.  Either way, it''s a wonderful idea but I think it would have worked a bit better if everything wasn''t mirrored.', '2003-11-17 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(487467, 47323, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is a littlle noise on the blue but nothing too horrid. I like the fact the lettering gets larger near the end, although the tops of the lettering blurs a little. Creative idea.</td>', 'There is a littlle noise on the blue but nothing too horrid. I like the fact the lettering gets larger near the end, although the tops of the lettering blurs a little. Creative idea.', '2003-11-17 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(487468, 47159, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot; perhaps it would have been good to include something else to give us a perspective that this was really "big".  Something that''s smaller than usual.  Or use distance perspective to make it look bigger than it is.</td>', 'Good shot; perhaps it would have been good to include something else to give us a perspective that this was really "big".  Something that''s smaller than usual.  Or use distance perspective to make it look bigger than it is.', '2003-11-17 00:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487470, 47304, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  Good scene and composition.  A little more contrast might improve this, and a bit of NeatImage for noise reduction.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  Good scene and composition.  A little more contrast might improve this, and a bit of NeatImage for noise reduction.', '2003-11-17 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487471, 46386, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I thought when I saw this was a feather decorated bathroom scales, kinda like those furry photo frames. Eeeek, I cringed! Now I see they are just being weighed. Interesting idea, colorful image, very fluffy. Dont really see much to improve on.</td>', 'First thing I thought when I saw this was a feather decorated bathroom scales, kinda like those furry photo frames. Eeeek, I cringed! Now I see they are just being weighed. Interesting idea, colorful image, very fluffy. Dont really see much to improve on.', '2003-11-17 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487475, 46991, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and I love the contrast. I used a similar theme in my still life entry but clearly didn''t pull it off as well as you did. The only criticism is that the six on your fingertips is slightly blurred (but hardly worth a deduction). By the way, had those been actual rolls on the craps table (in that order), you''d be sitting on a good bit more money.</td>', 'Excellent concept and I love the contrast. I used a similar theme in my still life entry but clearly didn''t pull it off as well as you did. The only criticism is that the six on your fingertips is slightly blurred (but hardly worth a deduction). By the way, had those been actual rolls on the craps table (in that order), you''d be sitting on a good bit more money.', '2003-11-17 00:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(487477, 47122, 6008, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some noise on the barrel, possibly due to the low lighting. I like the shadowed edge on the right, but the left could have done with being cropped a little more or something as there is something over there that''s a little distracting. I havent heard of the expression but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, I''m sure it''s a saying somewhere. The money doesnt seem very sharp on the top of the barrel either, again, possibly due to the lighting situation.</td>', 'There seems to be some noise on the barrel, possibly due to the low lighting. I like the shadowed edge on the right, but the left could have done with being cropped a little more or something as there is something over there that''s a little distracting. I havent heard of the expression but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, I''m sure it''s a saying somewhere. The money doesnt seem very sharp on the top of the barrel either, again, possibly due to the lighting situation.', '2003-11-17 00:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487478, 46975, 6668, '<td valign="top">adorable shot...nice capture. 8</td>', 'adorable shot...nice capture. 8', '2003-11-17 00:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(487480, 46789, 6870, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. Oreos. Fun title matches your photo. Lighting is quite nice. Good idea!</td>', 'Mmmm. Oreos. Fun title matches your photo. Lighting is quite nice. Good idea!', '2003-11-17 00:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(487481, 47063, 6008, '<td valign="top">Ewwww! Yuck! Is that a spam tin? Makes it even more funny! Hrm, what to say about this. I like it despite it being rather gross. The white is white, it''s very clean and very sharp. No distracting shadows, lighting is excellent (except maybe the very tip of the tin but bah, that''s nothing). Very well thought of and executed.</td>', 'Ewwww! Yuck! Is that a spam tin? Makes it even more funny! Hrm, what to say about this. I like it despite it being rather gross. The white is white, it''s very clean and very sharp. No distracting shadows, lighting is excellent (except maybe the very tip of the tin but bah, that''s nothing). Very well thought of and executed.', '2003-11-17 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487482, 47263, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love the softness in this image. The model also has a genuinly inquisitive look that really captures the literalism of the title.</td>', 'I love the softness in this image. The model also has a genuinly inquisitive look that really captures the literalism of the title.', '2003-11-17 00:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(487484, 47004, 10691, '<td valign="top">Very powerful ... excellent composition. If only it were a bit darker and light was on ... !</td>', 'Very powerful ... excellent composition. If only it were a bit darker and light was on ... !', '2003-11-17 00:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(487486, 47063, 806, '<td valign="top">simply put ... "Bravo"!</td>', 'simply put ... "Bravo"!', '2003-11-17 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487487, 47358, 10691, '<td valign="top">Only the shadow prevents me from scoring this a perfect 10. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Only the shadow prevents me from scoring this a perfect 10. Wonderful shot!', '2003-11-17 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(487488, 47283, 12661, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this photo even though the next comment may very well complain that the bowl is too dark (don''t listen to them). It would have been interesting if you seperated the foreground from the background by adjusting the depth of field causing the bowl to be out-of-focus. But using the light works well too.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this photo even though the next comment may very well complain that the bowl is too dark (don''t listen to them). It would have been interesting if you seperated the foreground from the background by adjusting the depth of field causing the bowl to be out-of-focus. But using the light works well too.', '2003-11-17 00:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(487489, 47140, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very tricky!!!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very tricky!!!TC', '2003-11-17 00:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487491, 47242, 6008, '<td valign="top">The title is confusing me a little but I assume you mean something similar to ''dont move a muscle'' which I understand. The lighting is good, the focus is good, certainly captured the stop motion and it links well to the title. It''s a well shot candid. Street photography is always a nice thing to see.</td>', 'The title is confusing me a little but I assume you mean something similar to ''dont move a muscle'' which I understand. The lighting is good, the focus is good, certainly captured the stop motion and it links well to the title. It''s a well shot candid. Street photography is always a nice thing to see.', '2003-11-17 00:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487495, 47338, 12661, '<td valign="top">The red background really plays well with the black pipe and gold holder. Unfortunately, the image is very grainy and could have benefitted from some despeckling. As far as the literalism is concerned, putting something in the bowl may have made a stronger imapct. Maybe a piece of paper with a visible title reading "recent poll" or something else that one would show while using the phrase. Then again, why ruin a classic shot of a beautiful pipe. ;)</td>', 'The red background really plays well with the black pipe and gold holder. Unfortunately, the image is very grainy and could have benefitted from some despeckling. As far as the literalism is concerned, putting something in the bowl may have made a stronger imapct. Maybe a piece of paper with a visible title reading "recent poll" or something else that one would show while using the phrase. Then again, why ruin a classic shot of a beautiful pipe. ;)', '2003-11-17 00:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(487497, 47353, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how the color suits the mood of the image. Using the noose as a frame is also good. Shame about the line near the top, which I assume is the start of the ceiling. His right shoulder (on our left) blends into the background a little, and that whole left area seems a little dark compared to the brigher blue on the other side. A creative idea that is well executed. Well done.</td>', 'I like how the color suits the mood of the image. Using the noose as a frame is also good. Shame about the line near the top, which I assume is the start of the ceiling. His right shoulder (on our left) blends into the background a little, and that whole left area seems a little dark compared to the brigher blue on the other side. A creative idea that is well executed. Well done.', '2003-11-17 00:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(487499, 46804, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like the picture. Great concept. Colors are good, clarity is phenomenal. I like being able to make out the dew drops on the apples. <br/>I think the different colors for the back wall and the (table?) detract some.<br/>Would have liked to have seen the focus on the fist apple, instead of the middle.<br/>Also thought using oranges instead of eggs may have added a bit of punch and another layer of idiom to the photo.<br/>7<br/></td>', 'I like the picture. Great concept. Colors are good, clarity is phenomenal. I like being able to make out the dew drops on the apples. I think the different colors for the back wall and the (table?) detract some.Would have liked to have seen the focus on the fist apple, instead of the middle.Also thought using oranges instead of eggs may have added a bit of punch and another layer of idiom to the photo.7', '2003-11-17 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(487502, 47236, 12661, '<td valign="top">Well, this is going straight to my list of photographs to come back to after the challenge in the hopes of finding out what it is.  A very interesting perspective of whatever it is.</td>', 'Well, this is going straight to my list of photographs to come back to after the challenge in the hopes of finding out what it is.  A very interesting perspective of whatever it is.', '2003-11-17 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487503, 47333, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color mix and brightness suggests this was played around with in editing software. Whereas the idea of having feathers in the image coupled with the common phrase is good, I personally dislike color-manipulated images of this fashion. I''m sure some people like it and can give you some honest and good feedback, but this just isnt my cup of tea.</td>', 'The color mix and brightness suggests this was played around with in editing software. Whereas the idea of having feathers in the image coupled with the common phrase is good, I personally dislike color-manipulated images of this fashion. I''m sure some people like it and can give you some honest and good feedback, but this just isnt my cup of tea.', '2003-11-17 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(487506, 47288, 12661, '<td valign="top">I saw the title, I saw the claw of the hammer. I was afraid to scroll down. LOL.  Very nice literalism.</td>', 'I saw the title, I saw the claw of the hammer. I was afraid to scroll down. LOL.  Very nice literalism.', '2003-11-17 01:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487507, 47330, 259, '<td valign="top">awesome, awesome shot.  i love the crop and everything about your pic.  great job.  my fav this week for sure.</td>', 'awesome, awesome shot.  i love the crop and everything about your pic.  great job.  my fav this week for sure.', '2003-11-17 01:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
