(487512, 47164, 13576, '<td valign="top">you captured beautiful colors. I know those sunrise, sunset shots can be tough because of the contrast and the limited time you have to work with the lighting. However, the brightness/contrast adjustments seem too harsh to me.<br/> <br/>\</td>', 'you captured beautiful colors. I know those sunrise, sunset shots can be tough because of the contrast and the limited time you have to work with the lighting. However, the brightness/contrast adjustments seem too harsh to me. \', '2003-11-17 01:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
