(487526, 47240, 13576, '<td valign="top">I have seen a couple of photos done with all the saturation removed in all but on specific thing or color. I do not understand how this can be done without spot editing. If you could please explain how this is done.<br/></td>', 'I have seen a couple of photos done with all the saturation removed in all but on specific thing or color. I do not understand how this can be done without spot editing. If you could please explain how this is done.', '2003-11-17 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
