(487528, 47363, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like you interpretation of this challenge. I am just afraid that many of the people voting won''t have any idea what a vacuum tube is (or was).</td>', 'I like you interpretation of this challenge. I am just afraid that many of the people voting won''t have any idea what a vacuum tube is (or was).', '2003-11-17 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
