(487702, 46890, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice clear bee shot but I find it distracting that you chose a landscape approach rather than portrait.  And bees in November?  Not around here.  I find that the light is also a bit flat.  Great DOF.</td>', 'Nice clear bee shot but I find it distracting that you chose a landscape approach rather than portrait.  And bees in November?  Not around here.  I find that the light is also a bit flat.  Great DOF.', '2003-11-17 06:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487703, 47338, 11738, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pipe and holder, but there seesm to be a lot of noise in this image.  The image is also quite dark.  I would have liked to have been able to see more of the base.</td>', 'Beautiful pipe and holder, but there seesm to be a lot of noise in this image.  The image is also quite dark.  I would have liked to have been able to see more of the base.', '2003-11-17 06:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487704, 47022, 11738, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm... brake jam, Arrrrrrr &lt;drool&gt;.  Clever idea.</td>', 'Mmmmm... brake jam, Arrrrrrr <drool>.  Clever idea.', '2003-11-17 06:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487705, 46863, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Naughty, naughty pencils.  I hope they didn''t leave any... er... um... "stains" on your paper :P  There does seem to be some noise on their "pillow".</td>', 'Too funny!  Naughty, naughty pencils.  I hope they didn''t leave any... er... um... "stains" on your paper :P  There does seem to be some noise on their "pillow".', '2003-11-17 07:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(487708, 47022, 6678, '<td valign="top">Very clever - I like it. But will the Americans get it?</td>', 'Very clever - I like it. But will the Americans get it?', '2003-11-17 07:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(487709, 47240, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love how you have desaturated the hand and have kept the globe''s vibrant colours.  Lighting is also very good.  I also appreciate that you centered on Africa rather than the too often selected North America - South America perspective.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love how you have desaturated the hand and have kept the globe''s vibrant colours.  Lighting is also very good.  I also appreciate that you centered on Africa rather than the too often selected North America - South America perspective.', '2003-11-17 07:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487715, 47302, 6678, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Edelbrock Victor Jnr Intake Manifold Bolt to me. Torque it to 50 lb ft.. Very nice shot</td>', 'Looks like a Edelbrock Victor Jnr Intake Manifold Bolt to me. Torque it to 50 lb ft.. Very nice shot', '2003-11-17 07:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(487717, 47366, 11738, '<td valign="top">Arrrrgh!  I hope that''s not your everyday wallet :P  I can just imagine it:<br/> <br/> "Sniff... sniff...Um, do you smell that?"<br/> <br/>"Um... No... No I don''t" &lt;quickly walks away while mumbling that he shouldn''t have used his everyday wallet&gt;<br/> <br/>A great idea and very well done.  I think focus could have been just a hair sharper.</td>', 'Arrrrgh!  I hope that''s not your everyday wallet :P  I can just imagine it:  "Sniff... sniff...Um, do you smell that?" "Um... No... No I don''t" <quickly walks away while mumbling that he shouldn''t have used his everyday wallet> A great idea and very well done.  I think focus could have been just a hair sharper.', '2003-11-17 07:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(487719, 46427, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with the bird and all, but that white spot is too blown out for my taste.</td>', 'Nice shot with the bird and all, but that white spot is too blown out for my taste.', '2003-11-17 07:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(487731, 46454, 11738, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  This tiling must have taken quite a bit of time to complete.  I laso like the way you have positioned some of the words, such as in the lower righthand corner where you have placed "best" and "sex" together.  Intentional?</td>', 'Original idea.  This tiling must have taken quite a bit of time to complete.  I laso like the way you have positioned some of the words, such as in the lower righthand corner where you have placed "best" and "sex" together.  Intentional?', '2003-11-17 07:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487740, 47140, 11738, '<td valign="top">I almost sumitted this for DQ.  Glad I didn''t.  Took me awhile to figure this one out.  I think what you did here was rotate the original image 180 degrees.  Too bad about that faint white line over (or should I say under) the glass at the top left part of the image.  Great illusion!</td>', 'I almost sumitted this for DQ.  Glad I didn''t.  Took me awhile to figure this one out.  I think what you did here was rotate the original image 180 degrees.  Too bad about that faint white line over (or should I say under) the glass at the top left part of the image.  Great illusion!', '2003-11-17 07:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(487768, 47027, 12061, '<td valign="top">lol very good idea, and this picture looks great! I think the white background could be a bit brighter if you adjusted curves in PS a little more - but its not that big a deal. Great job!</td>', 'lol very good idea, and this picture looks great! I think the white background could be a bit brighter if you adjusted curves in PS a little more - but its not that big a deal. Great job!', '2003-11-17 08:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(487770, 46991, 12061, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the quality of the picture could be better though. The edges are funny, with the orange glow. It looks as though it was taken at a high ISO because its a little grainy. You did capture the rolling dice very nicely though</td>', 'Great idea, the quality of the picture could be better though. The edges are funny, with the orange glow. It looks as though it was taken at a high ISO because its a little grainy. You did capture the rolling dice very nicely though', '2003-11-17 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(487772, 47253, 12061, '<td valign="top">awww look at that poor lonely egg there all by himself *snicker* Nice shot, I really like the reflection. Focus, lighting - all great. Nice job.</td>', 'awww look at that poor lonely egg there all by himself *snicker* Nice shot, I really like the reflection. Focus, lighting - all great. Nice job.', '2003-11-17 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487779, 47340, 12061, '<td valign="top">A suggestion - I think this would be very nice as a b&amp;w photo. I can''t quite pinpoint it, but there is something missing in this one, I feel it should be more dramatic. On the opposite side however, nice choice for this challenge and nice job.</td>', 'A suggestion - I think this would be very nice as a b&w photo. I can''t quite pinpoint it, but there is something missing in this one, I feel it should be more dramatic. On the opposite side however, nice choice for this challenge and nice job.', '2003-11-17 08:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487784, 46991, 13957, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect... just a few places I can see your supports...</td>', 'Almost perfect... just a few places I can see your supports...', '2003-11-17 08:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(487788, 46672, 13957, '<td valign="top">Creative...</td>', 'Creative...', '2003-11-17 08:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(487790, 47326, 13957, '<td valign="top">Funny....</td>', 'Funny....', '2003-11-17 08:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(487791, 47334, 13957, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF</td>', 'Good use of DOF', '2003-11-17 08:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(487792, 46877, 13957, '<td valign="top">Creative...</td>', 'Creative...', '2003-11-17 08:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487794, 46362, 12061, '<td valign="top">haha hilarious choice for the challenge, its very fitting. I like the crop, nice choice keeping it vertical.</td>', 'haha hilarious choice for the challenge, its very fitting. I like the crop, nice choice keeping it vertical.', '2003-11-17 08:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487801, 47321, 13957, '<td valign="top">You spent a lot of time on this... nice work.</td>', 'You spent a lot of time on this... nice work.', '2003-11-17 08:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487802, 46653, 8159, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but I guess I don''t get it. I don''t see the "drink" part of your literal title. I just see a drop of water and a nail (which if large enough, is also called a spike). I like the concept of "spiking a drink", but I probably would have put a "spike" in a martini glass and photographed that...</td>', 'Cool picture, but I guess I don''t get it. I don''t see the "drink" part of your literal title. I just see a drop of water and a nail (which if large enough, is also called a spike). I like the concept of "spiking a drink", but I probably would have put a "spike" in a martini glass and photographed that...', '2003-11-17 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487806, 47063, 8159, '<td valign="top">That is so gross! :) It reminds me of something I met see on the TV show "Fear Factor". It must have been tricky photographing those slimey things without them getting your perfectly clean white background all nasty. Anyway... great shot!</td>', 'That is so gross! :) It reminds me of something I met see on the TV show "Fear Factor". It must have been tricky photographing those slimey things without them getting your perfectly clean white background all nasty. Anyway... great shot!', '2003-11-17 08:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(487818, 47301, 7543, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over sharpened (clearly seen at the back of the man). Composition good, nice setting. 7</td>', 'Seems a bit over sharpened (clearly seen at the back of the man). Composition good, nice setting. 7', '2003-11-17 09:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487819, 47347, 12061, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and lighting! This picture looks so clean and is very attractive looking.</td>', 'very nice composition and lighting! This picture looks so clean and is very attractive looking.', '2003-11-17 09:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487820, 47302, 12061, '<td valign="top">clever! This is a great shot, reflection and focus is great.</td>', 'clever! This is a great shot, reflection and focus is great.', '2003-11-17 09:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(487821, 47250, 12061, '<td valign="top">haha great submission</td>', 'haha great submission', '2003-11-17 09:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(487822, 47303, 7543, '<td valign="top">The subject (horse) is way too dark (for my monitor at least), the lighting metering seems to be using the light of the sky, hence it''s under exposed. Good expression on the horses face.</td>', 'The subject (horse) is way too dark (for my monitor at least), the lighting metering seems to be using the light of the sky, hence it''s under exposed. Good expression on the horses face.', '2003-11-17 09:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487823, 47347, 7543, '<td valign="top">Some edges seem a bit jagged (the leftmost eggs for example). Nice setup and lighting. 7</td>', 'Some edges seem a bit jagged (the leftmost eggs for example). Nice setup and lighting. 7', '2003-11-17 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487825, 47263, 12061, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! A nice clean looking photo. Excellent angle, and soft tones <br/>b&amp;w works well.<br/>I do wish that the vine wasn''t behind her face so much.</td>', 'Excellent capture! A nice clean looking photo. Excellent angle, and soft tones b&w works well.I do wish that the vine wasn''t behind her face so much.', '2003-11-17 09:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487827, 47194, 12061, '<td valign="top">hehehe Nice work! Not only is this picture funny, its very good looking! :D</td>', 'hehehe Nice work! Not only is this picture funny, its very good looking! :D', '2003-11-17 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(487829, 47361, 12061, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Colors are nice, focus, composition and lighting great. <br/>I am not too fond of the background, it seems a bit pixelated or oversaturated - but not to the point of making this unattractive photo, because I think its a great shot.</td>', 'Nice work. Colors are nice, focus, composition and lighting great. I am not too fond of the background, it seems a bit pixelated or oversaturated - but not to the point of making this unattractive photo, because I think its a great shot.', '2003-11-17 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487830, 47063, 9387, '<td valign="top">I can barely stand to look at the picture --I have a phobia about worms, but the photo is very well done so you get an 8.</td>', 'I can barely stand to look at the picture --I have a phobia about worms, but the photo is very well done so you get an 8.', '2003-11-17 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(487831, 47313, 12061, '<td valign="top">Nice! I would have cropped a little bit more off the left side to make the black space equal, other than that ... I can''t see anything. Nice job</td>', 'Nice! I would have cropped a little bit more off the left side to make the black space equal, other than that ... I can''t see anything. Nice job', '2003-11-17 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(487832, 47348, 12061, '<td valign="top">Very theme-appropriate. Nice angle, colors are vibrant and appealing. <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Very theme-appropriate. Nice angle, colors are vibrant and appealing. Great job.', '2003-11-17 09:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(487835, 46770, 12061, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea, I feel that the photograph could have been a little better<br/>the string and needle look over saturated or contrasted<br/>I think the clock hands would look better in focus rather than out of, perhaps with the numbers out of focus. <br/>what I do like about this photo is the colors, the white space, the composition, and the simpless of it.</td>', 'this is a great idea, I feel that the photograph could have been a little betterthe string and needle look over saturated or contrastedI think the clock hands would look better in focus rather than out of, perhaps with the numbers out of focus. what I do like about this photo is the colors, the white space, the composition, and the simpless of it.', '2003-11-17 09:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(487836, 47263, 4338, '<td valign="top">wonderful image</td>', 'wonderful image', '2003-11-17 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(487837, 47333, 12061, '<td valign="top">Whoa....what is this supposed to be? The effect you were going for isn''t working for me, its hard to tell what this picture is supposed to represent. The title you are working with suggests that maybe if you had a feather on a weighing meter it would make sense</td>', 'Whoa....what is this supposed to be? The effect you were going for isn''t working for me, its hard to tell what this picture is supposed to represent. The title you are working with suggests that maybe if you had a feather on a weighing meter it would make sense', '2003-11-17 09:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(487839, 47047, 12061, '<td valign="top">awesome geography here, wow, quite amazing. I really like the contrast of colors happening. <br/>I like how the distant mountains are slightly out of focus, it really adds. Great job.</td>', 'awesome geography here, wow, quite amazing. I really like the contrast of colors happening. I like how the distant mountains are slightly out of focus, it really adds. Great job.', '2003-11-17 09:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487841, 46825, 12061, '<td valign="top">Fun idea :D I really think the penny on the top looks great - I would like to see the background brightened up a *little more, but not too much because the contrast between the top penny and the ones underneath does work. DOF nice.</td>', 'Fun idea :D I really think the penny on the top looks great - I would like to see the background brightened up a *little more, but not too much because the contrast between the top penny and the ones underneath does work. DOF nice.', '2003-11-17 09:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(487842, 47221, 12061, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I love the color contrast.<br/>Focus is great, lighting very effective. Great job :D</td>', 'Great composition! I love the color contrast.Focus is great, lighting very effective. Great job :D', '2003-11-17 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487843, 47022, 4338, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2003-11-17 09:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(487844, 47199, 9387, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge excellently.  I love the lieralism and  the portrayal of it.  Very well done.</td>', 'This fits the challenge excellently.  I love the lieralism and  the portrayal of it.  Very well done.', '2003-11-17 09:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(487845, 46817, 12061, '<td valign="top">I think focusing needs improvement, The red cent should be the main subject, yet its not fully in focus</td>', 'I think focusing needs improvement, The red cent should be the main subject, yet its not fully in focus', '2003-11-17 09:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487846, 46599, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  This photo fits the literalism and I like the idea.  Carried out well.  Good composition, good definition in the focal point and a great idea.</td>', 'Very well done!  This photo fits the literalism and I like the idea.  Carried out well.  Good composition, good definition in the focal point and a great idea.', '2003-11-17 09:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(487848, 47366, 9387, '<td valign="top">I had a good chuckle when I saw this photo.  Great literalism portrayed.  This picture is perfect.  Great idea, great composition, good definition and color.  I don''t see one thing wrong so as far as I''m concerned you have achieved perfection.  A 10 for you!</td>', 'I had a good chuckle when I saw this photo.  Great literalism portrayed.  This picture is perfect.  Great idea, great composition, good definition and color.  I don''t see one thing wrong so as far as I''m concerned you have achieved perfection.  A 10 for you!', '2003-11-17 09:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(487851, 46832, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  The composition is good, you have managed to capture the subtle tones of the leaves and acorn and a good literalism.</td>', 'Good picture.  The composition is good, you have managed to capture the subtle tones of the leaves and acorn and a good literalism.', '2003-11-17 09:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(487853, 47340, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great --wish I had thought of this.</td>', 'Great --wish I had thought of this.', '2003-11-17 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(487856, 47047, 13925, '<td valign="top">breathtaking!</td>', 'breathtaking!', '2003-11-17 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487857, 47211, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very well done and a great idea.  Good composition, great color on the cheese and good definition on the end of the cheese.  My only critique would be that the nearest side of the knife is a little over exposed.  Otherwise a near perfect photo.  I give it a 9.</td>', 'Very well done and a great idea.  Good composition, great color on the cheese and good definition on the end of the cheese.  My only critique would be that the nearest side of the knife is a little over exposed.  Otherwise a near perfect photo.  I give it a 9.', '2003-11-17 09:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487858, 46386, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very well done and a hard literalism to pull off.  You have done a great job!</td>', 'Very well done and a hard literalism to pull off.  You have done a great job!', '2003-11-17 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487860, 47194, 9387, '<td valign="top">I love your idea, your portrayal of the idea and that it is in black and white.  However, it could have been perfect if the left side of the had wasn''t over exposed.</td>', 'I love your idea, your portrayal of the idea and that it is in black and white.  However, it could have been perfect if the left side of the had wasn''t over exposed.', '2003-11-17 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(487861, 47339, 9387, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you did this but it is great.  Good job!</td>', 'I have no idea how you did this but it is great.  Good job!', '2003-11-17 09:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487862, 46362, 2891, '<td valign="top">This is just funny.  Great for a busy monday morning...</td>', 'This is just funny.  Great for a busy monday morning...', '2003-11-17 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(487863, 46516, 9387, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea of this literalism but thought it would have portrayed that better if the rose was actually between 2 thorns.  The silver from the fork with it''s reflection is kind of distracting.</td>', 'I liked the idea of this literalism but thought it would have portrayed that better if the rose was actually between 2 thorns.  The silver from the fork with it''s reflection is kind of distracting.', '2003-11-17 09:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(487864, 47100, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I like this idea very much I think your photo could be imporved.  The center seems to be blown out from the flash and none of it is very sharp.</td>', 'While I like this idea very much I think your photo could be imporved.  The center seems to be blown out from the flash and none of it is very sharp.', '2003-11-17 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(487867, 47348, 2891, '<td valign="top">The color in the sky is great.  I like the blue.  My only issue with this is that the lighting is just harsh, as if it were taken close to noon.  The perspective and aspect are good, especially if there is no cropping done.</td>', 'The color in the sky is great.  I like the blue.  My only issue with this is that the lighting is just harsh, as if it were taken close to noon.  The perspective and aspect are good, especially if there is no cropping done.', '2003-11-17 09:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(487869, 47063, 2891, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2003-11-17 09:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487871, 47301, 2891, '<td valign="top">nice mood.</td>', 'nice mood.', '2003-11-17 09:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(487872, 47333, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I think you have picked a great literalism your portrayal of it is a little lacking.  This to me does not show in any way how light the feather is and the feather seems to have a lot of noise in it.  A little photo editing program might have helped.</td>', 'While I think you have picked a great literalism your portrayal of it is a little lacking.  This to me does not show in any way how light the feather is and the feather seems to have a lot of noise in it.  A little photo editing program might have helped.', '2003-11-17 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487876, 47296, 9387, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure if this is the best representation of the literalism you have picked, but the picture is very dim.  The animal at the top of the piece of wood blends into the background and nothing really appears to be sharp.</td>', 'I''m not really sure if this is the best representation of the literalism you have picked, but the picture is very dim.  The animal at the top of the piece of wood blends into the background and nothing really appears to be sharp.', '2003-11-17 09:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487880, 47018, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I like the literalism you have chosen I feel that the portrayal of it could be better.  In your photo the main color that pops out is the green from the leaves.  I can hardly tell what "is in the red" and on my monitor it looks more like what is in the brown.  I am not taking points off for that because all monitors vary -- just saying that as an aside.</td>', 'While I like the literalism you have chosen I feel that the portrayal of it could be better.  In your photo the main color that pops out is the green from the leaves.  I can hardly tell what "is in the red" and on my monitor it looks more like what is in the brown.  I am not taking points off for that because all monitors vary -- just saying that as an aside.', '2003-11-17 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487887, 47195, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I like the literalism you have chosen I think it could have been portrayed a little better.  For starters the main subject of your photo should be the "babe" and I can barely distinguish it from the rest of the photo.  I had to look really hard to find it.  I also would have moved that one distracting branch off the leaves.  The photo looks a little dark in the main focus area and I might have cropped out the blurry part of the foreground as it is distracting and adds nothing to the photo.</td>', 'While I like the literalism you have chosen I think it could have been portrayed a little better.  For starters the main subject of your photo should be the "babe" and I can barely distinguish it from the rest of the photo.  I had to look really hard to find it.  I also would have moved that one distracting branch off the leaves.  The photo looks a little dark in the main focus area and I might have cropped out the blurry part of the foreground as it is distracting and adds nothing to the photo.', '2003-11-17 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(487891, 46723, 9387, '<td valign="top">There are so many things you could have done with this lietralism that just having a photo of your shoe doesn''t quite make it for me.  Maybe a picture of the shoe on the person (just the leg part maybe) walking down a road would have been better.  The literalism says "walking a mile" and this does not portray that although it is a very decent picture of the shoe.</td>', 'There are so many things you could have done with this lietralism that just having a photo of your shoe doesn''t quite make it for me.  Maybe a picture of the shoe on the person (just the leg part maybe) walking down a road would have been better.  The literalism says "walking a mile" and this does not portray that although it is a very decent picture of the shoe.', '2003-11-17 09:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(487893, 47336, 12061, '<td valign="top">I like the magnified look, it almost doesn''t look like a light bulb :) I like it.</td>', 'I like the magnified look, it almost doesn''t look like a light bulb :) I like it.', '2003-11-17 09:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
