(488484, 47143, 7628, '<td valign="top">yikes! I like the movement into the white space - you feel her intent.  I don''t like the shadow under her arm - it would be cleaner and starker without.  Wish the light came from below or behind to add a bit more drama.  (check out Magnus -if looks could kill - kinda of similar)</td>', 'yikes! I like the movement into the white space - you feel her intent.  I don''t like the shadow under her arm - it would be cleaner and starker without.  Wish the light came from below or behind to add a bit more drama.  (check out Magnus -if looks could kill - kinda of similar)', '2003-11-17 21:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488485, 46853, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool angle.  but how would it look from the side?  It might be easier to see the flames.</td>', 'Cool angle.  but how would it look from the side?  It might be easier to see the flames.', '2003-11-17 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
