(488489, 47365, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Wish both the mirror and the money could bein focus - with large enough DOF could be done depending on how far apart they are from eachother.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Wish both the mirror and the money could bein focus - with large enough DOF could be done depending on how far apart they are from eachother.', '2003-11-17 21:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(488490, 47049, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lot of points in this place, some literal and some figurative.  And after a long day in committee we ask, "What IS the point?  Lets get a pint!"  Sorry couldn''t resist.  Back to the point - Love this picture.  You are right on with the sharp siouettes and that beautiful sky.  I might crop just a bit off the bottom. 9</td>', 'A lot of points in this place, some literal and some figurative.  And after a long day in committee we ask, "What IS the point?  Lets get a pint!"  Sorry couldn''t resist.  Back to the point - Love this picture.  You are right on with the sharp siouettes and that beautiful sky.  I might crop just a bit off the bottom. 9', '2003-11-17 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(488491, 47199, 7628, '<td valign="top">cute.  I''m glad you added the pencils to give this pic a bit more dimension, wish they were lit a bit better maybe from the side?  You have a good graphic sense, I like your sign, but I''m not big on photos of 2 dimensional things.</td>', 'cute.  I''m glad you added the pencils to give this pic a bit more dimension, wish they were lit a bit better maybe from the side?  You have a good graphic sense, I like your sign, but I''m not big on photos of 2 dimensional things.', '2003-11-17 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(488494, 47330, 7628, '<td valign="top">very emotive, natural. I like how her hand is twisting the cord, I like the lighting and how it illuminates her smile and gives dimension to her face (nice DOF use too)  Composition of hands mouth and phone are just what is needed, no more, no less.  great! 10</td>', 'very emotive, natural. I like how her hand is twisting the cord, I like the lighting and how it illuminates her smile and gives dimension to her face (nice DOF use too)  Composition of hands mouth and phone are just what is needed, no more, no less.  great! 10', '2003-11-17 21:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(488495, 46427, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the bird flying into the light like thru an invisible tunnel.  Great clouds!  The colors are a bit odd - I would think warm colors would be more reassuring.</td>', 'I like the bird flying into the light like thru an invisible tunnel.  Great clouds!  The colors are a bit odd - I would think warm colors would be more reassuring.', '2003-11-17 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
