(488594, 47140, 6668, '<td valign="top">very nice...will be interesting to see how you did this...hope you didn''t end up with a pile of broken glass before you were done. :-)<br/> <br/>Never mind, it took me a minute to notice the table and that the picture was rotated, I figured it had to be something like that but a first glance I couldn''t see it.</td>', 'very nice...will be interesting to see how you did this...hope you didn''t end up with a pile of broken glass before you were done. :-) Never mind, it took me a minute to notice the table and that the picture was rotated, I figured it had to be something like that but a first glance I couldn''t see it.', '2003-11-17 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
