(488727, 47250, 8125, '<td valign="top">Color, clarity and composition - excellent.  Love the shot for this literalism.  The only thing I''m thinking is a tighter crop might have been better.  Great work  :-)</td>', 'Color, clarity and composition - excellent.  Love the shot for this literalism.  The only thing I''m thinking is a tighter crop might have been better.  Great work  :-)', '2003-11-18 08:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
