(488751, 47315, 6668, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand how the picture fits with the title, if I am missing something please let me know..thanks.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand how the picture fits with the title, if I am missing something please let me know..thanks.', '2003-11-18 09:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
