(488770, 46454, 14239, '<td valign="top">well done<br/></td>', 'well done', '2003-11-18 10:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488772, 46975, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great color, contrast, and clarity. Awesome photo. Would have love to edit the eye so it was opaque white and then rename the photo to "Even a Blind Squirrel Finds a Nut Sometimes. Its still my top selection for this challenge.</td>', 'Great color, contrast, and clarity. Awesome photo. Would have love to edit the eye so it was opaque white and then rename the photo to "Even a Blind Squirrel Finds a Nut Sometimes. Its still my top selection for this challenge.', '2003-11-18 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(488773, 47022, 10047, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, contrast, and different textures. Well done photo and literalism.</td>', 'Like the colors, contrast, and different textures. Well done photo and literalism.', '2003-11-18 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(488775, 46850, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I might have tried a looser crop, but I''m not sure how that would have looked. Good literalism.</td>', 'Great photo. I might have tried a looser crop, but I''m not sure how that would have looked. Good literalism.', '2003-11-18 10:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(488776, 47263, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice soft shades and a pretty model. The expression really says "listening". Wish I had thought of it because we have lots of wild grape vines around here.</td>', 'Nice soft shades and a pretty model. The expression really says "listening". Wish I had thought of it because we have lots of wild grape vines around here.', '2003-11-18 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(488779, 46914, 10047, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the soft focus was intentional, but I would like to have seen it sharper. The man''s seems to have alot of character.</td>', 'Not sure if the soft focus was intentional, but I would like to have seen it sharper. The man''s seems to have alot of character.', '2003-11-18 10:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(488781, 46853, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I would have tried a different angle. I like the concept and literalism.</td>', 'I think I would have tried a different angle. I like the concept and literalism.', '2003-11-18 10:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(488801, 47363, 6008, '<td valign="top">Firstly I admit my ignorance at not knowing what these items are. They look like strange light bulbs. I do know the saying and so I''m going to assume there is a link rather than vote you down for my ignorance. The mix of colors is interesting, it all looks fairly sharp, although I get a feeling of it being fairly cluttered. I dont know if these are singular items put together in a group of three or whether they are all connected, but my eyes are not sure on what part to look at. You have them dead center with some negative space above it. I''m not sure if the top black area was really needed. A close crop at the top to fill the frame may have helped more because of the tight crop at the bottom, giving it a slight symmetry. It''s not a wow shot to me, but it is certainly interesting.</td>', 'Firstly I admit my ignorance at not knowing what these items are. They look like strange light bulbs. I do know the saying and so I''m going to assume there is a link rather than vote you down for my ignorance. The mix of colors is interesting, it all looks fairly sharp, although I get a feeling of it being fairly cluttered. I dont know if these are singular items put together in a group of three or whether they are all connected, but my eyes are not sure on what part to look at. You have them dead center with some negative space above it. I''m not sure if the top black area was really needed. A close crop at the top to fill the frame may have helped more because of the tight crop at the bottom, giving it a slight symmetry. It''s not a wow shot to me, but it is certainly interesting.', '2003-11-18 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(488802, 47236, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this is stained glass window and so the middle item could possibly be a church organ or modern music/speaker thing? Or a staircase maybe? The shape almost looks like a black hole with a spacecraft about to fly into it. Not sure what to say about this - it''s certainly interesting. The light on the top of the center item looks like an overhead tube light, which is a little distracting. Very abstract.</td>', 'I''m assuming this is stained glass window and so the middle item could possibly be a church organ or modern music/speaker thing? Or a staircase maybe? The shape almost looks like a black hole with a spacecraft about to fly into it. Not sure what to say about this - it''s certainly interesting. The light on the top of the center item looks like an overhead tube light, which is a little distracting. Very abstract.', '2003-11-18 11:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(488804, 47221, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks like you may have some hot pixels, such a shame we cant clone. Anyways, the light reflections are good and miminal, something I often find annoying with fruit, especially the shiny kind. There feels like just the smallest amount of tilt with the apples higher than the oranges, otherwise it could be the heavier amount of shadow on the apples that are making it look like that. I''m assuming you had the light closer to the oranges, which is probably why they are more prominent and the apples are more in shadows. I like the shadows, it gives the feeling of much more dramatic lighting. The shadows on the bottom of the oranges just looks a little odd. Overall I like it, but there seems to be something missing and I''m not sure what.</td>', 'Looks like you may have some hot pixels, such a shame we cant clone. Anyways, the light reflections are good and miminal, something I often find annoying with fruit, especially the shiny kind. There feels like just the smallest amount of tilt with the apples higher than the oranges, otherwise it could be the heavier amount of shadow on the apples that are making it look like that. I''m assuming you had the light closer to the oranges, which is probably why they are more prominent and the apples are more in shadows. I like the shadows, it gives the feeling of much more dramatic lighting. The shadows on the bottom of the oranges just looks a little odd. Overall I like it, but there seems to be something missing and I''m not sure what.', '2003-11-18 11:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(488807, 46890, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the flower and bee in the corner, although not sure I like the background colors of red, orange, and green. I understand you likely had no control over it, but to me they seem to clash a little. Interesting use of dof also, not sure having the front wing OOF and the back wing in focus really adds that much and probably would have liked the entire bee in focus. It''s a good macro shot.</td>', 'I like the composition with the flower and bee in the corner, although not sure I like the background colors of red, orange, and green. I understand you likely had no control over it, but to me they seem to clash a little. Interesting use of dof also, not sure having the front wing OOF and the back wing in focus really adds that much and probably would have liked the entire bee in focus. It''s a good macro shot.', '2003-11-18 12:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(488808, 47261, 6008, '<td valign="top">Did the ball move or was this handheld? What is interesting is that the white of the ball clearly has some camera shake (or else you have a very dirty/smudged ball), but the doll is very sharp. This certainly has humor, but not really sure what else to say about it. The OOF 8 just seems to dominate the image, which I guess is the point of it due to the saying. This doesnt really do much for me, sorry.</td>', 'Did the ball move or was this handheld? What is interesting is that the white of the ball clearly has some camera shake (or else you have a very dirty/smudged ball), but the doll is very sharp. This certainly has humor, but not really sure what else to say about it. The OOF 8 just seems to dominate the image, which I guess is the point of it due to the saying. This doesnt really do much for me, sorry.', '2003-11-18 12:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(488810, 47349, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and I like how you have taken this is an open natural setting instead of indoors or somewhere with a modern background. The inclusion of some motion is good too, but the overall image isnt very sharp.</td>', 'Very colorful and I like how you have taken this is an open natural setting instead of indoors or somewhere with a modern background. The inclusion of some motion is good too, but the overall image isnt very sharp.', '2003-11-18 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(488811, 47330, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this! The lighting is good with lots of nice shadows and contrasts that makes the black and white work well. I also like the fact that you have got in close. The smile, the phone, and the twirling of the cord all suggest an intimacy, which is further complimented by the close crop. Very well expressed.</td>', 'I really like this! The lighting is good with lots of nice shadows and contrasts that makes the black and white work well. I also like the fact that you have got in close. The smile, the phone, and the twirling of the cord all suggest an intimacy, which is further complimented by the close crop. Very well expressed.', '2003-11-18 12:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(488839, 47270, 13991, '<td valign="top">wow, this is incredible. how was it done?</td>', 'wow, this is incredible. how was it done?', '2003-11-18 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(488855, 46877, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow, such an unique idea and wonderful interpretation! This would be 10 if I could vote, but I am only a user, so: Good luck for this challenge! :-)</td>', 'Wow, such an unique idea and wonderful interpretation! This would be 10 if I could vote, but I am only a user, so: Good luck for this challenge! :-)', '2003-11-18 13:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(488857, 47199, 14244, '<td valign="top">He he nice try for a winning spot! Very original but could have been better.</td>', 'He he nice try for a winning spot! Very original but could have been better.', '2003-11-18 13:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(488864, 46529, 9441, '<td valign="top">I really like the cropping and the way you captured each horse doing something different...nice job</td>', 'I really like the cropping and the way you captured each horse doing something different...nice job', '2003-11-18 14:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(488865, 46454, 9441, '<td valign="top">great composition and clarity!  The fact that every word is clear and readable is a big plus!</td>', 'great composition and clarity!  The fact that every word is clear and readable is a big plus!', '2003-11-18 14:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(488866, 47264, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome capture!  Terrific lighting, wonderful color hues, and the composition of the shot is fabulous...I''ll give it a 10</td>', 'awesome capture!  Terrific lighting, wonderful color hues, and the composition of the shot is fabulous...I''ll give it a 10', '2003-11-18 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488867, 47243, 9441, '<td valign="top">10 for sure!  This an amazing photo.  The ruffling of the feathers shows so much texture which adds alot of interest to the shot.  The stance of the birds is great, and I like what you have done with the coloring.  The way you cropped it makes it that much more dramatic...excellent job on this one....definitely one of my favorites yet!</td>', '10 for sure!  This an amazing photo.  The ruffling of the feathers shows so much texture which adds alot of interest to the shot.  The stance of the birds is great, and I like what you have done with the coloring.  The way you cropped it makes it that much more dramatic...excellent job on this one....definitely one of my favorites yet!', '2003-11-18 14:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(488868, 46850, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific photo!  I like how the black crayon stands out so much clearer and sharper than the rest, the DOF is great!</td>', 'terrific photo!  I like how the black crayon stands out so much clearer and sharper than the rest, the DOF is great!', '2003-11-18 14:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
