(488875, 47302, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderfully done.  The reflection capture of the bolt is great, and I really like the vivid and bold color.  Good job!</td>', 'wonderfully done.  The reflection capture of the bolt is great, and I really like the vivid and bold color.  Good job!', '2003-11-18 14:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(488876, 47303, 9441, '<td valign="top">this almost doesn''t look real, it could be a painting..how awesome is this!  Good job, such an amazing capture and the clarity is outstanding!  10 from me</td>', 'this almost doesn''t look real, it could be a painting..how awesome is this!  Good job, such an amazing capture and the clarity is outstanding!  10 from me', '2003-11-18 14:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
