(488879, 47273, 9441, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling this portrays.  The angle at which you shot this definitely adds to that mood.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I like the feeling this portrays.  The angle at which you shot this definitely adds to that mood.  Very nicely done!', '2003-11-18 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(488881, 47194, 9441, '<td valign="top">great photo, and wonderful creativity!  Very clear and crisp feel to this shot.  10</td>', 'great photo, and wonderful creativity!  Very clear and crisp feel to this shot.  10', '2003-11-18 14:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(488882, 46975, 9441, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture!  His expression and pose is priceless.  The clarity and sharpness is superb, I have to give this one a 10!</td>', 'Fantastic capture!  His expression and pose is priceless.  The clarity and sharpness is superb, I have to give this one a 10!', '2003-11-18 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(488896, 47348, 6668, '<td valign="top">would be better without the shadow on the cactus in my opinion, maybe taken a different time of day or from a different angle. 5</td>', 'would be better without the shadow on the cactus in my opinion, maybe taken a different time of day or from a different angle. 5', '2003-11-18 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(489006, 47358, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very original.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-24 00:11:19.</i></td>', 'Very original.  ', '2003-11-18 15:53:39.000000', '2003-11-24 00:11:19.000000', 1),
(489031, 46877, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  I really like the movement here... and the red color of the driver really adds to this photo.  Good lighting... nice job with the black background.  How many tries did it take you to get this shot?  Very well done!  1 of 2 10''s for the challenge.</td>', 'This is wonderful!  I really like the movement here... and the red color of the driver really adds to this photo.  Good lighting... nice job with the black background.  How many tries did it take you to get this shot?  Very well done!  1 of 2 10''s for the challenge.', '2003-11-18 16:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(489035, 47194, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great image here... very surreal... good choice to do it in black and white.  This isn''t a straight photo I think?  The hand is very weird, almost looks a little like a solarization... but not quite... I like the effect, and the overall feel to the photo... plus it''s quite humorous!  Nicely done!  1 of 2 10''s in the challenge!  Good Luck!</td>', 'Great image here... very surreal... good choice to do it in black and white.  This isn''t a straight photo I think?  The hand is very weird, almost looks a little like a solarization... but not quite... I like the effect, and the overall feel to the photo... plus it''s quite humorous!  Nicely done!  1 of 2 10''s in the challenge!  Good Luck!', '2003-11-18 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(489041, 46853, 4967, '<td valign="top">I really feel that there is a lot that could be improved here.  I''m going to try and explain why I don''t care for this photo, hopefully you will get something out of it.  For one... I don''t really see anything interesting here, ok it''s a candle that has wax puddles on both sides, but there is no meaning to it besides your title.  For me it was hard to see what it was, even after I saw the title.  The straight down look to the shot is quite unappealing, while it is a different look then one might expect, I''m just not sure it works.  To me this shot could have been made more interesting 1, with it on some kind of a stand looking at it from the side 2, with some sort of a bright colored candle (blue or green etc.) 3, I can''t tell if it''s burning or not, I think it is but it''s hard to see, burning from the side, seeing the flame would be nice 4, a white background so that the wax from the brightly colored candle would show up brilliantly and 5, wait for possibly a drip to shoot the photo.  As it is, I''m sorry, but I gave it a 1.</td>', 'I really feel that there is a lot that could be improved here.  I''m going to try and explain why I don''t care for this photo, hopefully you will get something out of it.  For one... I don''t really see anything interesting here, ok it''s a candle that has wax puddles on both sides, but there is no meaning to it besides your title.  For me it was hard to see what it was, even after I saw the title.  The straight down look to the shot is quite unappealing, while it is a different look then one might expect, I''m just not sure it works.  To me this shot could have been made more interesting 1, with it on some kind of a stand looking at it from the side 2, with some sort of a bright colored candle (blue or green etc.) 3, I can''t tell if it''s burning or not, I think it is but it''s hard to see, burning from the side, seeing the flame would be nice 4, a white background so that the wax from the brightly colored candle would show up brilliantly and 5, wait for possibly a drip to shoot the photo.  As it is, I''m sorry, but I gave it a 1.', '2003-11-18 16:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(489042, 46789, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative, and a good literalistic interpretation of the phrase.  Photographically, this isn''t clear for some reason.  Also, the white part of the cookie is overexposed.  If your camera or software support''s histograms, that''s a good way to watch for these things.  Look for an exposure where the histogram approaches but does not quite reach the right exposure limit.<br/> <br/>Supplementary information exchanged via email in response to the authors query (put here with the picture for the benefit of others):<br/> <br/>----------------------------------------------------------<br/> <br/>It'' s hard for me to tell why your photo doesnt look clear from the small<br/>photo, but here''s some theories:<br/> <br/>1) It may be noise.  Long exposures on most digital cameras result in a<br/>noisy image, much like using high ISO values.  Or if you were set to a high<br/>ISO value, or used automatic exposure where the camera can vary the ISO<br/>value for greater sensitivity, that would introduce noise.<br/> <br/>2) It may be oversharpened.  That cause contrast halos to appear, which can<br/>actually make a photo less clear.  Especially one with a lot of detail or<br/>some noise to begin with.<br/> <br/>3) It could be the result of JPEG artifacts, from using too high a<br/>compression ratio (or as the setting often goes, too low a quality setting).<br/>  I can''t tell because its small; I see something that looks like a block<br/>effect on the table, but it also could be a texture or pattern.<br/> <br/>No, I don''t think the overexposed regions is why it''s unclear, but the long<br/>exposure could have something to do with it if the floor, room, or tripod<br/>vibrated at all, even ever so slightly.  For example, if its on a tripod, on<br/>a wood or plywood based floor, and someone trodded by, there could by a<br/>slight vibration which could cause lack of clarity.<br/> <br/>As far as the histogram article, my G2 makes it really easy to spot<br/>overexposed areas when using the histogram function.  You see there are<br/>overexposed areas in the thumbnail, and it goes a step further and flashes<br/>the overexposed regions in the thumbnail.  I don''t know if your S20 supports<br/>that.  My son has an A60, and it doesn''t have this function.<br/> <br/>Here''s an article online that might be some help.<br/> <br/>//www.luminous-landscape.com/tutorials/understanding-series/understanding-histograms.shtml<br/> <br/>I also recommend Scott Kelby''s series, The Photoshop Book for Digital<br/>Photographers, and the equivalent one for Elements (which is what I have.)<br/></td>', 'Very imaginative, and a good literalistic interpretation of the phrase.  Photographically, this isn''t clear for some reason.  Also, the white part of the cookie is overexposed.  If your camera or software support''s histograms, that''s a good way to watch for these things.  Look for an exposure where the histogram approaches but does not quite reach the right exposure limit. Supplementary information exchanged via email in response to the authors query (put here with the picture for the benefit of others): ---------------------------------------------------------- It'' s hard for me to tell why your photo doesnt look clear from the smallphoto, but here''s some theories: 1) It may be noise.  Long exposures on most digital cameras result in anoisy image, much like using high ISO values.  Or if you were set to a highISO value, or used automatic exposure where the camera can vary the ISOvalue for greater sensitivity, that would introduce noise. 2) It may be oversharpened.  That cause contrast halos to appear, which canactually make a photo less clear.  Especially one with a lot of detail orsome noise to begin with. 3) It could be the result of JPEG artifacts, from using too high acompression ratio (or as the setting often goes, too low a quality setting).  I can''t tell because its small; I see something that looks like a blockeffect on the table, but it also could be a texture or pattern. No, I don''t think the overexposed regions is why it''s unclear, but the longexposure could have something to do with it if the floor, room, or tripodvibrated at all, even ever so slightly.  For example, if its on a tripod, ona wood or plywood based floor, and someone trodded by, there could by aslight vibration which could cause lack of clarity. As far as the histogram article, my G2 makes it really easy to spotoverexposed areas when using the histogram function.  You see there areoverexposed areas in the thumbnail, and it goes a step further and flashesthe overexposed regions in the thumbnail.  I don''t know if your S20 supportsthat.  My son has an A60, and it doesn''t have this function. Here''s an article online that might be some help. //www.luminous-landscape.com/tutorials/understanding-series/understanding-histograms.shtml I also recommend Scott Kelby''s series, The Photoshop Book for DigitalPhotographers, and the equivalent one for Elements (which is what I have.)', '2003-11-18 16:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(489067, 47253, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo...love the reflection and the clarity of the picture..10 from me</td>', 'wonderful photo...love the reflection and the clarity of the picture..10 from me', '2003-11-18 17:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(489070, 46562, 9441, '<td valign="top">very good DOF, nice composition and arrangement</td>', 'very good DOF, nice composition and arrangement', '2003-11-18 17:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(489071, 47336, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is a phrase I know, but who cares when the photography is this good? Absolutely perfect. Might even be the first print I buy, if you''ll put it in dpcp.<br/> <br/>Later ... just gets better every time I see it. Reminds me of some of the early photographic experiments, guys like emerson and Goodall, or Fenton even perhaps. It''s that strange un-worldly shading around the edge of the bulb of glass, the way the thickness of the glass produces a dark ring and almost a halo. Would I be right in guessing this isn''t actually a blaxk and white shot, but rather a heavily de-saturated full colour image? Seems to have tints of purple, and amber in it. The only way to portray such depth on computers that I know of ... good luck, I hope this wins.</td>', 'Not sure this is a phrase I know, but who cares when the photography is this good? Absolutely perfect. Might even be the first print I buy, if you''ll put it in dpcp. Later ... just gets better every time I see it. Reminds me of some of the early photographic experiments, guys like emerson and Goodall, or Fenton even perhaps. It''s that strange un-worldly shading around the edge of the bulb of glass, the way the thickness of the glass produces a dark ring and almost a halo. Would I be right in guessing this isn''t actually a blaxk and white shot, but rather a heavily de-saturated full colour image? Seems to have tints of purple, and amber in it. The only way to portray such depth on computers that I know of ... good luck, I hope this wins.', '2003-11-18 17:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(489073, 47339, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome photo!  Sure to be a top pick...I''ll give it a 10...the clarity is great, and the capture of motion excellent!  I love it in the b&amp;w, adds to the mood of the photo...congrats on a terrific shot!</td>', 'awesome photo!  Sure to be a top pick...I''ll give it a 10...the clarity is great, and the capture of motion excellent!  I love it in the b&w, adds to the mood of the photo...congrats on a terrific shot!', '2003-11-18 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(489074, 47063, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderfully clear photo..I can almost feel these "icky" worms!  Good job on this one.</td>', 'wonderfully clear photo..I can almost feel these "icky" worms!  Good job on this one.', '2003-11-18 17:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(489075, 47352, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you might win with this - I have , er, six shots that I find more intersting, but there''s something very dpc about this. Contrast between the pattern of the jeans and the texture of the shirt is well brought out, and of course it absolutely nails the idea. Good luck - but I hope you don''t beat my fave (if that isn''t rude).</td>', 'I think you might win with this - I have , er, six shots that I find more intersting, but there''s something very dpc about this. Contrast between the pattern of the jeans and the texture of the shirt is well brought out, and of course it absolutely nails the idea. Good luck - but I hope you don''t beat my fave (if that isn''t rude).', '2003-11-18 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(489076, 46834, 9441, '<td valign="top">very pretty...looks like a painting...I really like the color tones and hues here...nice job.</td>', 'very pretty...looks like a painting...I really like the color tones and hues here...nice job.', '2003-11-18 17:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(489078, 47240, 6999, '<td valign="top">De-saturation works, despite what it''s done to central asia and presumably africa. Good light, neat idea, just a bit too blunt for my taste. Be very surprised if you don''t ribbon for it though. 8</td>', 'De-saturation works, despite what it''s done to central asia and presumably africa. Good light, neat idea, just a bit too blunt for my taste. Be very surprised if you don''t ribbon for it though. 8', '2003-11-18 17:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(489080, 47161, 6999, '<td valign="top">Never heard the expression, but happy to believe in it. Cool photo - excellently lit, composed. Captured some meanness, and some dynamic (the shading around the eyes is masterful. There''ve been some real gems in this chllenge, and this is one of the top six for me. Good luck.</td>', 'Never heard the expression, but happy to believe in it. Cool photo - excellently lit, composed. Captured some meanness, and some dynamic (the shading around the eyes is masterful. There''ve been some real gems in this chllenge, and this is one of the top six for me. Good luck.', '2003-11-18 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(489081, 47199, 6999, '<td valign="top">The barrel distortion is ruining this for me: if you shoot from so close in it''s very difficult to avoid - but if you get just a little further away and then crop closer in editing, or use some of the zoomrange of the camera (if you have any), it''ll lessen it enormously. Contrast on the lettering is fine, but the arrangement of the pens, and the lighting there is a bit weak - particularly the way the tip of the black pencil disappears into the background. Good thinking though.</td>', 'The barrel distortion is ruining this for me: if you shoot from so close in it''s very difficult to avoid - but if you get just a little further away and then crop closer in editing, or use some of the zoomrange of the camera (if you have any), it''ll lessen it enormously. Contrast on the lettering is fine, but the arrangement of the pens, and the lighting there is a bit weak - particularly the way the tip of the black pencil disappears into the background. Good thinking though.', '2003-11-18 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(489082, 47366, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the idea - something lets it down though photographically. Not that there''s anything specifically wrong with it technically, but I think perhaps the composition is too arbitrary: why not show all of the wallet? Why have the driver licence so prominent? Actually you''ve ended up with the bacon dead centre of image - I can imagine this much stronger if you had the entire wallet in shot, opened symettrically toward the lens, with the bacon sticking out at exactly the same angle. Nice effort though.</td>', 'Like the idea - something lets it down though photographically. Not that there''s anything specifically wrong with it technically, but I think perhaps the composition is too arbitrary: why not show all of the wallet? Why have the driver licence so prominent? Actually you''ve ended up with the bacon dead centre of image - I can imagine this much stronger if you had the entire wallet in shot, opened symettrically toward the lens, with the bacon sticking out at exactly the same angle. Nice effort though.', '2003-11-18 17:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(489182, 47336, 10643, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic, best I''ve seen yet in the challenge. I love the texture and detail.</td>', 'this is fantastic, best I''ve seen yet in the challenge. I love the texture and detail.', '2003-11-18 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(489210, 46672, 13091, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. Colors could get a bit of level boosting.</td>', 'Very good idea. Colors could get a bit of level boosting.', '2003-11-18 22:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(489224, 47063, 6504, '<td valign="top">This should really be disgusting and it turns out to be a very good photograph, and very clever on top of it.  I think it''s the winner.   (Now where did you get the worms??)  And... what did you do with them later?</td>', 'This should really be disgusting and it turns out to be a very good photograph, and very clever on top of it.  I think it''s the winner.   (Now where did you get the worms??)  And... what did you do with them later?', '2003-11-18 23:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(489230, 46890, 12694, '<td valign="top">i love the orange and yellows!  nice shot</td>', 'i love the orange and yellows!  nice shot', '2003-11-18 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(489231, 47022, 12694, '<td valign="top">too funny.  hope that jam isn''t on my front rotor!  great pic.</td>', 'too funny.  hope that jam isn''t on my front rotor!  great pic.', '2003-11-18 23:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(489234, 47140, 12694, '<td valign="top">i see how you did this.  cool effect.</td>', 'i see how you did this.  cool effect.', '2003-11-18 23:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(489236, 47313, 13576, '<td valign="top">Awesome!<br/>Perfect for this challenge. Use of black and white helps to keep focus on what matters. Very dynamic, great use of lighting. Focus good. 10</td>', 'Awesome!Perfect for this challenge. Use of black and white helps to keep focus on what matters. Very dynamic, great use of lighting. Focus good. 10', '2003-11-18 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(489239, 46653, 7778, '<td valign="top">While this technically accomplished photo may provide considerable delight for those with a particular interest, both the emotional appeal and sensory range may be considered too limited for the generalist. The central composition, IMHO, contributes staticity.</td>', 'While this technically accomplished photo may provide considerable delight for those with a particular interest, both the emotional appeal and sensory range may be considered too limited for the generalist. The central composition, IMHO, contributes staticity.', '2003-11-18 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(489240, 47326, 12694, '<td valign="top">i hope this one wins.   why?  cuz winblows  IS full of bugs... way to go!  10 for sure!  great idea and great pic!</td>', 'i hope this one wins.   why?  cuz winblows  IS full of bugs... way to go!  10 for sure!  great idea and great pic!', '2003-11-18 23:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(489243, 47199, 13576, '<td valign="top">Cute Concept.  Good concept execution. Lighting is good, focus is good, and composition is good. I like it.</td>', 'Cute Concept.  Good concept execution. Lighting is good, focus is good, and composition is good. I like it.', '2003-11-18 23:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(489247, 47350, 7778, '<td valign="top">One of few entries in this challenge which consider an aesthetic measure of a photo above a ''clever interpretation of trivial matters''. The title, nevertheless, proves that a challenge can be met and met well on more than one front.<br/> <br/>Good, natural rendering and apt composition of an interesting subject. If the pelican''s beak were a little crisper, the image could be breath-taking. The evenly dark sky (?) is ominous and complimentary.</td>', 'One of few entries in this challenge which consider an aesthetic measure of a photo above a ''clever interpretation of trivial matters''. The title, nevertheless, proves that a challenge can be met and met well on more than one front. Good, natural rendering and apt composition of an interesting subject. If the pelican''s beak were a little crisper, the image could be breath-taking. The evenly dark sky (?) is ominous and complimentary.', '2003-11-18 23:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(489399, 47283, 13578, '<td valign="top">i have those bowls! :)</td>', 'i have those bowls! :)', '2003-11-19 02:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(489555, 47263, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tone is good, I like the focus, it has a nice soft feel to it. I realise the thing on the side of her face is the grapevine, but it kinda looks odd in the shot. The lighting is also good. It''s an odd photo to vote on. Without the grapevine it would be a very pretty portrait but off topic, and yet with the grapevine it''s on topic but has a fairly large distraction. I like it anyways!</td>', 'The tone is good, I like the focus, it has a nice soft feel to it. I realise the thing on the side of her face is the grapevine, but it kinda looks odd in the shot. The lighting is also good. It''s an odd photo to vote on. Without the grapevine it would be a very pretty portrait but off topic, and yet with the grapevine it''s on topic but has a fairly large distraction. I like it anyways!', '2003-11-19 05:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(489561, 47304, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is good and very funny. I can just imagine someone giving directions and actually meaning this type of fork in the road and yet our conceived notion assumes the other. It''s very simplistic and stark, not sure if you added the grain/noise or it''s natural, but I like it. Contrasts are good, composition is good, I like the addition of the grass bank on the left. Good idea!</td>', 'This is good and very funny. I can just imagine someone giving directions and actually meaning this type of fork in the road and yet our conceived notion assumes the other. It''s very simplistic and stark, not sure if you added the grain/noise or it''s natural, but I like it. Contrasts are good, composition is good, I like the addition of the grass bank on the left. Good idea!', '2003-11-19 05:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(489575, 47172, 6008, '<td valign="top">The look in the horse''s eye suggests s/he was not very happy with this shot! Probably the only glaring thing I dont really like is the fencepost and wire/fence in the bottom right. Other than that it''s a fairly humorous shot.</td>', 'The look in the horse''s eye suggests s/he was not very happy with this shot! Probably the only glaring thing I dont really like is the fencepost and wire/fence in the bottom right. Other than that it''s a fairly humorous shot.', '2003-11-19 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(489577, 46362, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute in a funny kind of way! You did well with the reflections on the glass. The lighting is good as is the crop. The only things I dont really care for are the water droplets/splashes on the side of the glass.</td>', 'Cute in a funny kind of way! You did well with the reflections on the glass. The lighting is good as is the crop. The only things I dont really care for are the water droplets/splashes on the side of the glass.', '2003-11-19 06:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(489580, 47194, 6008, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture the nice textures of the bag, and I think the lighting/shadows leant themselves well to the black and white. The partly mirrored reflection is a nice touch too. Although it''s not really a common phrase, it still is a literal representation. The lighting seems just a tad too harsh on the thumb. Overall a good shot.</td>', 'You managed to capture the nice textures of the bag, and I think the lighting/shadows leant themselves well to the black and white. The partly mirrored reflection is a nice touch too. Although it''s not really a common phrase, it still is a literal representation. The lighting seems just a tad too harsh on the thumb. Overall a good shot.', '2003-11-19 06:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(489782, 46832, 2883, '<td valign="top">Too much similar colors, it all blends in together. The acorn doesn''t really appear tiny either. Maybe setting it next to the trund of an oak would help.</td>', 'Too much similar colors, it all blends in together. The acorn doesn''t really appear tiny either. Maybe setting it next to the trund of an oak would help.', '2003-11-19 09:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(489783, 47333, 2883, '<td valign="top">Interesting play on the ''light'' part of the phrase. I would only add a little more black on the right upper side to balance to bright feather.</td>', 'Interesting play on the ''light'' part of the phrase. I would only add a little more black on the right upper side to balance to bright feather.', '2003-11-19 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(489785, 47302, 2883, '<td valign="top">I think this would fit the phrase better if the bolt was partially driven into the blue surface. It''s a nice clean photo and I like the coloring and composition.</td>', 'I think this would fit the phrase better if the bolt was partially driven into the blue surface. It''s a nice clean photo and I like the coloring and composition.', '2003-11-19 09:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(489788, 46682, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean photo. I could see the greens of the background enhanced a bit.</td>', 'Nice, clean photo. I could see the greens of the background enhanced a bit.', '2003-11-19 09:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(489790, 47143, 2883, '<td valign="top">She looks a little too dressed up to be out for murder. Good expression on the face. A little more cropping on the left side would help give the appearance that there may possibly be someone there to stab.</td>', 'She looks a little too dressed up to be out for murder. Good expression on the face. A little more cropping on the left side would help give the appearance that there may possibly be someone there to stab.', '2003-11-19 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(489793, 47199, 2883, '<td valign="top">I think the title shown in the photo is a little distracting, as well as the surface under the black paper.</td>', 'I think the title shown in the photo is a little distracting, as well as the surface under the black paper.', '2003-11-19 09:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(489795, 47027, 2883, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The lighting could be improved a bit. The hard shadows are distracting.</td>', 'Good idea. The lighting could be improved a bit. The hard shadows are distracting.', '2003-11-19 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(489796, 47243, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and detail. I also like the two-tone effect.</td>', 'Nice composition and detail. I also like the two-tone effect.', '2003-11-19 09:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(489799, 47357, 2883, '<td valign="top">How true indeed! Good, clean photo. The lighter stripe in the upper right background is a little distracting. I like the paper puppets.</td>', 'How true indeed! Good, clean photo. The lighter stripe in the upper right background is a little distracting. I like the paper puppets.', '2003-11-19 09:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(489803, 47348, 2883, '<td valign="top">I''ve always thought of a cactus as being more prickly than sticky. Good composition and nice blue sky.</td>', 'I''ve always thought of a cactus as being more prickly than sticky. Good composition and nice blue sky.', '2003-11-19 09:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(489804, 47172, 2883, '<td valign="top">The expression in the horse''s eye almost makes it look drunk. Perhaps these two had a night on the town, which would explain the title. The fence in the lower right corner is a little distracting, but overall it''s a decent photo.</td>', 'The expression in the horse''s eye almost makes it look drunk. Perhaps these two had a night on the town, which would explain the title. The fence in the lower right corner is a little distracting, but overall it''s a decent photo.', '2003-11-19 09:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(489805, 47356, 2883, '<td valign="top">The tablecloth pattern is distracting and the overall photo is a little bright and fuzzy.</td>', 'The tablecloth pattern is distracting and the overall photo is a little bright and fuzzy.', '2003-11-19 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
