(490110, 47240, 9441, '<td valign="top">really good job on this one.  Nice clear photo.  The color contrast is great, and the concept is wonderful!  10+</td>', 'really good job on this one.  Nice clear photo.  The color contrast is great, and the concept is wonderful!  10+', '2003-11-19 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
