(490419, 47321, 11738, '<td valign="top">First of all I can''t imagine how this got a DQ request.  Congrats on a great idea and an awesome execution.  I''m not sure but the windows look like pieces of electrician''s tape.  The needles used for the lights, handles and antenna are way, way cool.  Just a super idea.  Best of luck and I''ll be very disapointed if you don''t ribbon.  My only 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'First of all I can''t imagine how this got a DQ request.  Congrats on a great idea and an awesome execution.  I''m not sure but the windows look like pieces of electrician''s tape.  The needles used for the lights, handles and antenna are way, way cool.  Just a super idea.  Best of luck and I''ll be very disapointed if you don''t ribbon.  My only 10 for this challenge.', '2003-11-19 19:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(490428, 46789, 11738, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but the execution could use some more work.  Image seems out of focus and the cookie cream in the lower right-hand corner is blown out (too bright).  This might have been avoided by repositioning your light source to a different angle.</td>', 'A good idea, but the execution could use some more work.  Image seems out of focus and the cookie cream in the lower right-hand corner is blown out (too bright).  This might have been avoided by repositioning your light source to a different angle.', '2003-11-19 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(490435, 46770, 11738, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but this photo is overexposed.  I like the colour thread you used, but the colour''s richness is washed out by by the overbearing whitness of the background.  The clock hands are out of focus: you may want to try increasing the depth of field next time.  I also find the crop is just a tad too tight.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but this photo is overexposed.  I like the colour thread you used, but the colour''s richness is washed out by by the overbearing whitness of the background.  The clock hands are out of focus: you may want to try increasing the depth of field next time.  I also find the crop is just a tad too tight.', '2003-11-19 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(490438, 47333, 11738, '<td valign="top">The colour treatment you have selected is interesting although very hard on the eyes.  This is probably the most difficult photo to study visually.  You may want to decrease contrast if you try something like this again.</td>', 'The colour treatment you have selected is interesting although very hard on the eyes.  This is probably the most difficult photo to study visually.  You may want to decrease contrast if you try something like this again.', '2003-11-19 20:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
