(490563, 47302, 12611, '<td valign="top">This shot just looks so pleasing. I love the shadow fading. very very nice. 9.95</td>', 'This shot just looks so pleasing. I love the shadow fading. very very nice. 9.95', '2003-11-19 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(490565, 46682, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot and perspective/composition- you included just enough of the water and bridge. The light and shadow is good- but the color reveals teh digital brown-green of the water. I wish this was a bit more vivid and contrasty- but only luck could really improve that aspect(time of day, weather, etc). still its great, nice shot.</td>', 'Awesome shot and perspective/composition- you included just enough of the water and bridge. The light and shadow is good- but the color reveals teh digital brown-green of the water. I wish this was a bit more vivid and contrasty- but only luck could really improve that aspect(time of day, weather, etc). still its great, nice shot.', '2003-11-19 22:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(490567, 47315, 12611, '<td valign="top">propaganda? still a nice black adn white. wish you could spot edit to get reid of the light above the first "M". But, as it goes, its acceptable.</td>', 'propaganda? still a nice black adn white. wish you could spot edit to get reid of the light above the first "M". But, as it goes, its acceptable.', '2003-11-19 22:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(490570, 47253, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the egg shell out of the basket. Nice fluid nature of the basket reflection. Poor sad egg.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the egg shell out of the basket. Nice fluid nature of the basket reflection. Poor sad egg.', '2003-11-19 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(490571, 47323, 12611, '<td valign="top">Clever. Nice blue and black combo. Like it alot. the d should be a bit smaller though, with the letters getting bigger- but heck- its still great.</td>', 'Clever. Nice blue and black combo. Like it alot. the d should be a bit smaller though, with the letters getting bigger- but heck- its still great.', '2003-11-19 22:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(490572, 46770, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice try- but, the crispness is just not there, maybe its the angle, I do like the purpel though.</td>', 'Nice try- but, the crispness is just not there, maybe its the angle, I do like the purpel though.', '2003-11-19 22:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(490574, 46789, 12611, '<td valign="top">This shot is so interesting. The white lardy parts of the cookie look like fire. the lighting looks like a shot from a surveillance helicopter into someones back yard. I love it.</td>', 'This shot is so interesting. The white lardy parts of the cookie look like fire. the lighting looks like a shot from a surveillance helicopter into someones back yard. I love it.', '2003-11-19 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(490578, 47350, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice zoomy shot. Thats a scary graceful bird. Such a connection birds have to dinosaurs- they never became extinct:)</td>', 'Nice zoomy shot. Thats a scary graceful bird. Such a connection birds have to dinosaurs- they never became extinct:)', '2003-11-19 22:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(490581, 46889, 12611, '<td valign="top">It seems to be over my head- but then the simplicity is there. and there is no connection really- adn thats the thing. so i guess it works.</td>', 'It seems to be over my head- but then the simplicity is there. and there is no connection really- adn thats the thing. so i guess it works.', '2003-11-19 22:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(490673, 47063, 9780, '<td valign="top">Ok i was eating my breakfast!!! NOW I will starv for a day!!!!</td>', 'Ok i was eating my breakfast!!! NOW I will starv for a day!!!!', '2003-11-20 02:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(490675, 46825, 9780, '<td valign="top">I like the collor of this photo and the DOF is just perfect.</td>', 'I like the collor of this photo and the DOF is just perfect.', '2003-11-20 02:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(490758, 47264, 14362, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric and evocative</td>', 'Very atmospheric and evocative', '2003-11-20 06:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(490779, 47350, 14256, '<td valign="top">excellent zoom, great colours</td>', 'excellent zoom, great colours', '2003-11-20 08:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(490795, 47264, 12061, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Very peaceful and serene.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Very peaceful and serene.', '2003-11-20 08:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(490825, 47350, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot. Having recently tried some wildlife photography I can appreciate how difficult it is to get a shot like this. The negative space is good, complimenting the feeling of flying. The image is sharp with good color and light. Contrasts are also good. I dont really see anything that could be improved on. Well done.</td>', 'This is a very good shot. Having recently tried some wildlife photography I can appreciate how difficult it is to get a shot like this. The negative space is good, complimenting the feeling of flying. The image is sharp with good color and light. Contrasts are also good. I dont really see anything that could be improved on. Well done.', '2003-11-20 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(490827, 47354, 6008, '<td valign="top">The card seems slightly tilted, not sure if that was your intention of not. It''s very minimalistic, conveys the phrase well, and the card isnt blown out, although there seems to be uneven color tones if you look at the lower left compared to around the A. It''s good, just doesnt have much wow factor for me.</td>', 'The card seems slightly tilted, not sure if that was your intention of not. It''s very minimalistic, conveys the phrase well, and the card isnt blown out, although there seems to be uneven color tones if you look at the lower left compared to around the A. It''s good, just doesnt have much wow factor for me.', '2003-11-20 09:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(490832, 46991, 6008, '<td valign="top">The hand and furthest die are a little OOF but I''m not sure if that is because of DOF or motion. My eyes seem to go to the hand more than the chips so I think I would have liked to have seen it more in focus. The lighting is good, a little bright on three of them, but not overly so. I''m not sure if you have the 12 die there in those positions hoping to come across like there are only two being rolled, or you only used 2 and a long exposure, although they seem a little solid with no obvious motion if you did the latter. If your attempt was the former then as I said above they seem a little too solid. Nevertheless, a good shot.</td>', 'The hand and furthest die are a little OOF but I''m not sure if that is because of DOF or motion. My eyes seem to go to the hand more than the chips so I think I would have liked to have seen it more in focus. The lighting is good, a little bright on three of them, but not overly so. I''m not sure if you have the 12 die there in those positions hoping to come across like there are only two being rolled, or you only used 2 and a long exposure, although they seem a little solid with no obvious motion if you did the latter. If your attempt was the former then as I said above they seem a little too solid. Nevertheless, a good shot.', '2003-11-20 09:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(490833, 47211, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste the cheese! Nice capture of the textures, and a clever interpretation of the expression.</td>', 'I can almost taste the cheese! Nice capture of the textures, and a clever interpretation of the expression.', '2003-11-20 09:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(490834, 47316, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and I like how the fingers are framed in such a way as to lead the eye over to the coin. After looking at it for a while I find the inside finger in the center of the fingers to be a little distracting and would have rathered the center ''hole'' be completely black.</td>', 'Interesting idea and I like how the fingers are framed in such a way as to lead the eye over to the coin. After looking at it for a while I find the inside finger in the center of the fingers to be a little distracting and would have rathered the center ''hole'' be completely black.', '2003-11-20 09:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(490835, 47240, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is the black surrounding the hand and then the texture of the fabric in the lower right. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but I''m not sure what it could represent other than maybe stars, but that''s a bit of a stretch. The light reflection on the world suggests that is the direction of the light so maybe lifting your hand off the fabric may have helped blacken that corner more. The whole black and white with color thing is interesting, it certainly makes the world stand out here. I''m sure there is a neat metaphor with why the hand/holder is in grayscale and the world is in color! The image is sharp and clean, I like it.</td>', 'First thing I notice is the black surrounding the hand and then the texture of the fabric in the lower right. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but I''m not sure what it could represent other than maybe stars, but that''s a bit of a stretch. The light reflection on the world suggests that is the direction of the light so maybe lifting your hand off the fabric may have helped blacken that corner more. The whole black and white with color thing is interesting, it certainly makes the world stand out here. I''m sure there is a neat metaphor with why the hand/holder is in grayscale and the world is in color! The image is sharp and clean, I like it.', '2003-11-20 09:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(490838, 47164, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice colors, slightly soft but I think that goes with the mellow feeling of the scene. One suggestions, though, is to have flipped the image so the letters N and S are the right way around. The plane would still be flying to the south, but the viewer''s eyes wouldnt be drawn so much to the backward letters.</td>', 'Good composition, nice colors, slightly soft but I think that goes with the mellow feeling of the scene. One suggestions, though, is to have flipped the image so the letters N and S are the right way around. The plane would still be flying to the south, but the viewer''s eyes wouldnt be drawn so much to the backward letters.', '2003-11-20 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(490841, 47100, 6008, '<td valign="top">I feel this should have even been a close up shot or probably vertical. There is a lot of empty space on the sides and yet the top of the bouquet has been cropped. Cropping off some flowers is sometimes ok if you have it full frame and there is cropping on all sides, but because this is only at the top I feel it has a severed feeling. The mix of pinks and reds on the flower are good, lighting is good with nothing blown or too dark. The connection to the phrase is good. Only thing letting it down is I think it really needed to be a vertical shot.</td>', 'I feel this should have even been a close up shot or probably vertical. There is a lot of empty space on the sides and yet the top of the bouquet has been cropped. Cropping off some flowers is sometimes ok if you have it full frame and there is cropping on all sides, but because this is only at the top I feel it has a severed feeling. The mix of pinks and reds on the flower are good, lighting is good with nothing blown or too dark. The connection to the phrase is good. Only thing letting it down is I think it really needed to be a vertical shot.', '2003-11-20 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(490851, 46590, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. I''d like it better with enough depth of field for the bottom leaves to be in focus.</td>', 'Pretty shot. I''d like it better with enough depth of field for the bottom leaves to be in focus.', '2003-11-20 09:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(490853, 47140, 9441, '<td valign="top">very cool!  Great composition and clarity.  Not sure how you did this but it''s awesome!  10+</td>', 'very cool!  Great composition and clarity.  Not sure how you did this but it''s awesome!  10+', '2003-11-20 09:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(490858, 47063, 14035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clean image. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Beautiful clean image. Excellent composition.', '2003-11-20 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(490861, 47358, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors and shadows.  Nice composition and clarity.</td>', 'wonderful colors and shadows.  Nice composition and clarity.', '2003-11-20 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(490863, 47348, 12733, '<td valign="top">The low angle is really dramatic. Nice shot.</td>', 'The low angle is really dramatic. Nice shot.', '2003-11-20 09:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(490864, 47336, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the tone of this! I''m curious to see what type of background you used, or whether it is just the mix of light, duotone, and contrast. The image is so sharp as well, very clear. There are far too many things I like about this. Certainly my fav so far.</td>', 'I love the tone of this! I''m curious to see what type of background you used, or whether it is just the mix of light, duotone, and contrast. The image is so sharp as well, very clear. There are far too many things I like about this. Certainly my fav so far.', '2003-11-20 09:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(490868, 46682, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the water, reflections and shape of the bridge. I think a longer lens or tighter crop to remove the large dark expanse in the foreground would have made a stronger picture.</td>', 'I like the water, reflections and shape of the bridge. I think a longer lens or tighter crop to remove the large dark expanse in the foreground would have made a stronger picture.', '2003-11-20 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(490871, 47287, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and treatment.</td>', 'Nice idea and treatment.', '2003-11-20 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(490874, 47240, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice lighting and texture.</td>', 'Good idea, nice lighting and texture.', '2003-11-20 09:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(490877, 46807, 12733, '<td valign="top">That is one tough-looking dog.</td>', 'That is one tough-looking dog.', '2003-11-20 09:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(490882, 47122, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture in the barrel, but the cash looks too contrasty for my taste, and the coins appear to be out of focus.</td>', 'Nice color and texture in the barrel, but the cash looks too contrasty for my taste, and the coins appear to be out of focus.', '2003-11-20 09:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(490885, 47236, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern surrounding the sound - what is it?</td>', 'Interesting pattern surrounding the sound - what is it?', '2003-11-20 09:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(490894, 46832, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and textures, along with a good interpretation of the question.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and textures, along with a good interpretation of the question.', '2003-11-20 09:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(490897, 47100, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the roses, and the STOP sign is a nice touch. I think the words "and smell the roses" on the sign is a bit much.</td>', 'I love the roses, and the STOP sign is a nice touch. I think the words "and smell the roses" on the sign is a bit much.', '2003-11-20 09:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(490902, 47336, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the filament.</td>', 'Nice detail on the filament.', '2003-11-20 09:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(490903, 46817, 12733, '<td valign="top">It actually looks red hot, but I guess that''s not really the case. An interesting interpretation of the challenge, and a nice closeup. Could have used a little more depth of field, imho.</td>', 'It actually looks red hot, but I guess that''s not really the case. An interesting interpretation of the challenge, and a nice closeup. Could have used a little more depth of field, imho.', '2003-11-20 10:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(490904, 47338, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures, smooth metal and rough wood.</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures, smooth metal and rough wood.', '2003-11-20 10:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(490905, 46804, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation, and interesting textures. The lighting loses the actual shapes of the eggs and, to some extent, the apples.</td>', 'Nice interpretation, and interesting textures. The lighting loses the actual shapes of the eggs and, to some extent, the apples.', '2003-11-20 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(490912, 46890, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great closeup; I think it would be improved with a tighter crop, leaving only a small part of the bright reddish flower.. The out of focus flowers on the left pull my gaze away from the bee and the flower it''s on.</td>', 'Great closeup; I think it would be improved with a tighter crop, leaving only a small part of the bright reddish flower.. The out of focus flowers on the left pull my gaze away from the bee and the flower it''s on.', '2003-11-20 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(490914, 47301, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very emotional picture, and it really illustrates the title.</td>', 'A very emotional picture, and it really illustrates the title.', '2003-11-20 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(490916, 46914, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a statement about poverty, and good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Quite a statement about poverty, and good composition and lighting.', '2003-11-20 10:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(490917, 46877, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur; good capture on the metal textures and highlights.</td>', 'Nice use of blur; good capture on the metal textures and highlights.', '2003-11-20 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(490920, 47358, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, and the colors knock your eye out.</td>', 'Cute idea, and the colors knock your eye out.', '2003-11-20 10:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(490924, 46975, 12733, '<td valign="top">The squirrel looks like he''s posting. Beautiful pose, textures and composition.</td>', 'The squirrel looks like he''s posting. Beautiful pose, textures and composition.', '2003-11-20 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(490926, 47350, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of the bird.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of the bird.', '2003-11-20 10:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(490931, 47340, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very funny. Nicely done.', '2003-11-20 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
