(492617, 46454, 5225, '<td valign="top">very clever use of the magnets!</td>', 'very clever use of the magnets!', '2003-11-23 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(492628, 47140, 5225, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2003-11-23 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(492629, 47195, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but I had to really search for the "babe" and even then it looks like a young woman.  First thing that came to mind when I saw this was baby and bath water type thing but that didn''t quit fit either.    The shot could use  a tighter crop to me, the front is just distraction at this point, to come in more on the tub with the surrounding trees would have been much more effective to me.   A 4</td>', 'Not a bad idea but I had to really search for the "babe" and even then it looks like a young woman.  First thing that came to mind when I saw this was baby and bath water type thing but that didn''t quit fit either.    The shot could use  a tighter crop to me, the front is just distraction at this point, to come in more on the tub with the surrounding trees would have been much more effective to me.   A 4', '2003-11-23 10:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(492631, 47164, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good idea overall but the execution of the shot left me wanting.  I love the sky, the colors but the clarity and the reversal of the letters leaves me wanting.  I understand you wouldn''t have gotten the same backdrop coming from the other side but this way it almost looks like the picture was flipped over.  A 5</td>', 'A good idea overall but the execution of the shot left me wanting.  I love the sky, the colors but the clarity and the reversal of the letters leaves me wanting.  I understand you wouldn''t have gotten the same backdrop coming from the other side but this way it almost looks like the picture was flipped over.  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(492633, 47350, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I quite understand what you were going for here, it just doesn''t come across as literal to me for some reason but the shot is very nice, well done and it''s almost as if he''s looking right at you.  A 5</td>', 'Not sure I quite understand what you were going for here, it just doesn''t come across as literal to me for some reason but the shot is very nice, well done and it''s almost as if he''s looking right at you.  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(492634, 47365, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea; I''d like to have seen the broken mirror sharp as well as the money-or if limite DOF, maybe even the reverse.  Also, I think it would have been good if all lines didn''t meet near the center.</td>', 'Good idea; I''d like to have seen the broken mirror sharp as well as the money-or if limite DOF, maybe even the reverse.  Also, I think it would have been good if all lines didn''t meet near the center.', '2003-11-23 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(492635, 47316, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I love it!  The colors leave me wanting though and it seems it could be just a tad sharper though the cropping is well done and the contrast is there.  Also, looks like someone else is a nail biter like me, one reason I never shoot my own hands, :)  Started at a 5, am going to a 7</td>', 'Very cute, I love it!  The colors leave me wanting though and it seems it could be just a tad sharper though the cropping is well done and the contrast is there.  Also, looks like someone else is a nail biter like me, one reason I never shoot my own hands, :)  Started at a 5, am going to a 7', '2003-11-23 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(492636, 47055, 12448, '<td valign="top">While this is a lovely shot I don''t see how it feels the challenge of literalism.  I see no "love" per say and there''s a lot going on in the shot.  A 5</td>', 'While this is a lovely shot I don''t see how it feels the challenge of literalism.  I see no "love" per say and there''s a lot going on in the shot.  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(492637, 46910, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good idea and not a bad shot.  The picture looks slightly tilted to the right and to me, to make it really literal I would have had the glasses just in front of the camera so you could see the edges of the eyeglass frame, so you would see some of the real color around the edges.  Also the focus is just a tad too soft for my taste.  A 5</td>', 'A good idea and not a bad shot.  The picture looks slightly tilted to the right and to me, to make it really literal I would have had the glasses just in front of the camera so you could see the edges of the eyeglass frame, so you would see some of the real color around the edges.  Also the focus is just a tad too soft for my taste.  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(492639, 47236, 12448, '<td valign="top">It took me a second of looking to see that this is a tower of stained glass?  Very interesting, it does convey a sense of sound that you might be able to see if it was visiable but the angle of the shot throws me off a bit.  The center part looks distorted for some reason, maybe if you turned around and had the glass as the central focus with the stairwell as the backdrop?  A 5</td>', 'It took me a second of looking to see that this is a tower of stained glass?  Very interesting, it does convey a sense of sound that you might be able to see if it was visiable but the angle of the shot throws me off a bit.  The center part looks distorted for some reason, maybe if you turned around and had the glass as the central focus with the stairwell as the backdrop?  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(492642, 46853, 12448, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and probably fun to do.  It''s so hard shooting light and ot getting glares where the flame is, I"m still working on that.  The grain detracts from this shot for me, a bit more smooth and a bit more focus, clarity would really make this shot pop.  Also if you could somehow have the candle suspended instead of laying down, perhaps have a nail through the middle in the back so it''s away from the table, have the wax dripping down instead of pooling.  A 5</td>', 'Excellent idea and probably fun to do.  It''s so hard shooting light and ot getting glares where the flame is, I"m still working on that.  The grain detracts from this shot for me, a bit more smooth and a bit more focus, clarity would really make this shot pop.  Also if you could somehow have the candle suspended instead of laying down, perhaps have a nail through the middle in the back so it''s away from the table, have the wax dripping down instead of pooling.  A 5', '2003-11-23 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(492643, 47220, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good idea, numbering the eggs was a very nice touch.  The clarity on this is just off and I think having them in a nest of sorts would have been better to me, or even in an incubation type box as if you might really be trying to hatch them..  The lighting is well done, the shadows add a nice touch.  Started with a 5, going to a 6</td>', 'A good idea, numbering the eggs was a very nice touch.  The clarity on this is just off and I think having them in a nest of sorts would have been better to me, or even in an incubation type box as if you might really be trying to hatch them..  The lighting is well done, the shadows add a nice touch.  Started with a 5, going to a 6', '2003-11-23 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
