(492811, 46991, 14001, '<td valign="top">Clever idea with the dice, but I personally don''t think you pulled it off.  Too much change with the dice in the hand from the staged dice.  Needed a faster shutter maybe to isolate them more.  Maybe the lighting is the problem...don''t know.  Hand doesn''t seem to be in the correct position either.  7 for creativity.</td>', 'Clever idea with the dice, but I personally don''t think you pulled it off.  Too much change with the dice in the hand from the staged dice.  Needed a faster shutter maybe to isolate them more.  Maybe the lighting is the problem...don''t know.  Hand doesn''t seem to be in the correct position either.  7 for creativity.', '2003-11-23 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
