(492822, 46914, 14001, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot!  That dog is wonderful!  But the photograph is not sharp at all.  Nothing in the shot appears sharp either.  To me, a picture like this needs to be in focus, showing "stark reality."  I''m interested to hear if that was what you intended, or it was a technical or equipment foul-up?</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot!  That dog is wonderful!  But the photograph is not sharp at all.  Nothing in the shot appears sharp either.  To me, a picture like this needs to be in focus, showing "stark reality."  I''m interested to hear if that was what you intended, or it was a technical or equipment foul-up?', '2003-11-23 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(492828, 46789, 2883, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. I like the contrasts. It looks a little overly sharpened though.</td>', 'Very nice idea. I like the contrasts. It looks a little overly sharpened though.', '2003-11-23 16:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
