(492986, 47336, 13576, '<td valign="top">Good Shot. I like the contrast. Focus is excellent. I feel like it''s missing something though. It feels a little bland. - 8 -</td>', 'Good Shot. I like the contrast. Focus is excellent. I feel like it''s missing something though. It feels a little bland. - 8 -', '2003-11-23 21:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
