(493439, 47326, 10858, '<td valign="top">Well, I couldn''t vote, because I am not a member. Unique idea and I love it, especially the colours of the CD. :-) I know it''s hard to take a good photo of CDs, I have tried it and I didn''t have much success. Honestly I would have voted a 9, I think, because of the skin tone. But that''s all. Indeed a great submission, congrats! I had a look at the scores around you, you would have deserved a better place. Maybe the subjective side of voting, because technically really very good - with the eyes of a beginner.</td>', 'Well, I couldn''t vote, because I am not a member. Unique idea and I love it, especially the colours of the CD. :-) I know it''s hard to take a good photo of CDs, I have tried it and I didn''t have much success. Honestly I would have voted a 9, I think, because of the skin tone. But that''s all. Indeed a great submission, congrats! I had a look at the scores around you, you would have deserved a better place. Maybe the subjective side of voting, because technically really very good - with the eyes of a beginner.', '2003-11-24 10:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
